@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12

participant "Producers" as P
participant "Host ingress\n(serialization point)" as H
participant "Core\n(evaluate)" as C
participant "Renderer /\nDevice" as D

P -> H : 1. receipts\n(receiptSequence assigned)
H -> H : 2. latch + close\nimmutable batch
H -> C : 3. validate and evaluate\none snapshot
C --> H : 4. logical outcome\n(commit or failed attempt)
H -> H : 5. capture committed\nevidence (before hooks)
H -> D : 6. dispatch committed\nsafe intent
D --> H : 7. effect result =\nnew correlated receipt
H -> H : 8. later batch: explicit\ntyped binding only
note over P, H : Steps 1 and 7 may happen\nasynchronously between boundaries
@enduml
